nocreadbench: CMD_BUF_AVAIL left its rest value in 0 of 36 points
  VERDICT: BOUNDED AT 36 -- the initiator holds at most this many read
  requests in flight (per-trid occupancy peaked at 39). Check it against
  the `dist` rows: a credit limit predicts cycles_per_tx = round_trip / 36,
  so cycles_per_tx MUST rise with hops. If the `dist` rows are flat, this
  bound is not what caps the rate either.
  CMD_BUF_AVAIL: DEGENERATE -- identical at rest and in every in-loop
  sample, so the register reports nothing about the command-buffer depth.
  Do not quote its value as a depth: it is an occupancy (reset default 0,
  paired with CMD_BUF_OVFL), and an occupancy that never moves is silence.
